file: connect-cicd-and-cloud-storage.md
consumers: [GreatVibe users, Mochi agents, support writers]
produces: [public steps to connect CI/CD platforms and object storage]
---
# Purpose
Walks a user through credential, connector, health check and first use for
CI/CD platforms and object storage (S3, Azure Blob, GCS, S3-compatible).

# Key Sections
- Credential types and scopes per service.
- Plain-language prompts to add connectors from templates.
- Health check results.
- CI/CD and storage example asks; Agent IQ CI/CD space.
- Tips: one CI/CD source per account, bucket-scoped keys, settings replace on
  update, AWS account pin, secrets out of settings.

# Dependencies
- `../reference/connector-template-types.md`
- `../concepts/what-is-a-connector.md`
- `add-aws-credential.md`

# Gotchas
- Rewritten fresh. Examples use example.com and placeholder names only. No
  account numbers, node IDs, internal routes or environment variable names.
- "Updating settings replaces them" reflects whole-map metadata replacement on
  connector update.

# Change History
- 2026-09-26: Created CI/CD and cloud storage connection guide.
